ke ten weeks in the womb.<br /> <br /> Yes, I am sure fear is an older response.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough. If fear develops first, that's a pretty decent measure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-28T02:16:38-07:00","id":901896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/885203-why-aren-t-there-horrors-of-things-other-than-fears?p=901851#post901851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The earliest recording of children masturbating is twenty three weeks in the womb.<br /> <br /> The earliest recording of children showing fear responses is something like ten weeks in the womb.<br /> <br /> Yes, I am sure fear is an older response.</div> </div> </div> </div> I did not know this. Kind of wish I still didn't. Masturbating fetuses, did not know they could do that. Three types of weirded out now, which for me is a rare experience, it takes alot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Me